{{-- WordPress's profile form (`wp-admin/user-edit.php` for the current user, `profile.php`), in WordPress's order and words: Personal Options, Name, Contact Info, About Yourself (with the Profile Picture), Account Management (New Password, Sessions) and Application Passwords, then "Update Profile". The picture, the sessions and the application passwords post their own forms, which sit after the profile form; their inputs join them with the `form` attribute, so the profile form does not send them. --}}<style>
#profile-page .form-table { border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 0.5em; width: 100%; clear: both; }
#profile-page .form-table th { color: #1d2327; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; padding: 20px 10px 20px 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 200px; }
#profile-page .form-table td { line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 9px; padding: 15px 10px; vertical-align: middle; }
#profile-page .form-table td p { margin: 4px 0 0; }
#profile-page h2 { color: #1d2327; font-size: 1.3em; margin: 1em 0; }
#profile-page .regular-text { width: 25em; max-width: 100%; }
#profile-page input[type="text"], #profile-page input[type="email"], #profile-page input[type="url"], #profile-page input[type="password"], #profile-page select, #profile-page textarea { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #8c8f94; border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 transparent; box-sizing: border-box; color: #2c3338; font-size: 14px; line-height: 2; min-height: 30px; padding: 0 8px; }
#profile-page textarea { line-height: 1.4; padding: 2px 6px; width: 100%; max-width: 500px; }
#profile-page input[disabled] { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5); border-color: rgba(220, 220, 222, 0.75); color: rgba(44, 51, 56, 0.5); }
#profile-page .description { color: #646970; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; }
#profile-page .button { background: #f6f7f7; border: 1px solid #2271b1; border-radius: 3px; color: #2271b1; cursor: pointer; display: inline-block; font-size: 13px; line-height: 2.15384615; min-height: 30px; padding: 0 10px; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: top; }
#profile-page .button[disabled] { background: #f6f7f7; border-color: #dcdcde; color: #a7aaad; cursor: default; }
#profile-page .button-primary { background: #2271b1; border-color: #2271b1; color: #fff; }
#profile-page .button-primary:hover { background: #135e96; border-color: #135e96; }
#profile-page .avatar { border-radius: 50%; height: 96px; object-fit: cover; width: 96px; }
#profile-page .avatar-initials { align-items: center; background: #c3c4c7; color: #1d2327; display: inline-flex; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 600; justify-content: center; text-transform: uppercase; }
#profile-page .mc-field-error { color: #d63638; }
#profile-page [aria-invalid="true"] { border-color: #d63638; }
#profile-page .wp-pwd { margin-top: 8px; }
#profile-page .wp-pwd .button { margin-left: 4px; }
#profile-page .application-passwords-list-table-wrapper { margin-top: 1em; }
#profile-page .widefat { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #c3c4c7; border-spacing: 0; width: 100%; }
#profile-page .widefat th, #profile-page .widefat td { padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left; }
#profile-page .widefat thead th { border-bottom: 1px solid #c3c4c7; }
#profile-page .create-application-password .form-field { margin: 1em 0; }
#profile-page .create-application-password label { display: block; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }
#profile-page .new-application-password-notice input { width: 25em; max-width: 100%; }
#profile-page .submit { margin-top: 20px; padding: 1.5em 0; }
#profile-page.js .hide-if-js, #profile-page:not(.js) .hide-if-no-js { display: none; }
</style>
